        <div class="day reveal"><div class="day__num">Day 1</div><div class="day__body"><h3>Welcome to Nairobi</h3><p>Met on arrival and taken to a gracious city hotel to rest and settle in.</p><p class="day__stay"><b>Stay:</b> Nairobi hotel · <b>Meals:</b> Dinner</p></div></div>
        <div class="day reveal"><div class="day__num">Days 2–4</div><div class="day__body"><h3>Maasai Mara</h3><p>Fly to the Mara for three full days of big cats, plains game and (in season) the Great Migration — with an optional balloon dawn and a Maasai community visit.</p><p class="day__stay"><b>Stay:</b> Luxury tented camp · <b>Meals:</b> All</p></div></div>
        <div class="day reveal"><div class="day__num">Day 5</div><div class="day__body"><h3>Amboseli &amp; Kilimanjaro</h3><p>Fly to Amboseli for elephants framed by Africa's highest peak — one of the continent's great views.</p><p class="day__stay"><b>Stay:</b> Amboseli lodge · <b>Meals:</b> All</p></div></div>
        <div class="day reveal"><div class="day__num">Day 6</div><div class="day__body"><h3>To the coast</h3><p>Fly to the Indian Ocean and transfer to your beach house. Toes in the sand by sunset.</p><p class="day__stay"><b>Stay:</b> Beach house / boutique hotel · <b>Meals:</b> Breakfast</p></div></div>
        <div class="day reveal"><div class="day__num">Days 7–9</div><div class="day__body"><h3>Barefoot days by the sea</h3><p>Three unhurried days: swim, snorkel, sail a dhow at sunset, spa mornings, Swahili dinners — exactly as much or as little as you wish.</p><p class="day__stay"><b>Stay:</b> Beach house / boutique hotel · <b>Meals:</b> Breakfast</p></div></div>
        <div class="day reveal"><div class="day__num">Day 10</div><div class="day__body"><h3>Farewell</h3><p>A final morning by the ocean, then transfer for your flight home, rested and glowing.</p><p class="day__stay"><b>Meals:</b> Breakfast</p></div></div>
